{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you survive in the wild northern Hispania of the 1st century BC? Step into the sandals of a Roman legionnaire in Summa Expeditionis: a survival, base building and strategy game. You have been sent to the last corner of the Empire and your mission is to go into uncharted territory, establish a fortified camp and grow enough to subdue these unruly barbarians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/camp_compressed_ultra.gif?t=1747211430\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a legend of Rome?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a legionary, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Empire's borders</strong> into hostile lands. Build your camp, manage resources, face barbarian tribes, and rise through the ranks to become a true military leader.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Historical Authenticity</strong> \u2013 Experience ancient Rome with stunning realism, from military equipment to dialogues in Latin.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in intense tactical battles against ruthless enemies.<br>\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Survival and Management</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, build settlements, and secure supplies for your troops.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Customization and Progression</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your gear, train soldiers, and adapt your strategy to conquer new lands.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Dynamic and Unique World</strong> \u2013 Every game is different thanks to <strong>procedural generation</strong>, ensuring new challenges and opportunities in each expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summa Expeditionis is more than a game: <strong>it\u2019s a test of wit, courage, and leadership</strong>. Will you answer Rome\u2019s call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Play now in Early Access and help shape the ultimate Roman Empire experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/summa_expeditionis_title_compressed_ultra.gif?t=1747211430\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the legion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2056200/5ea955d500d7dbff0776d456f1f4ade7e3b56f16.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2056200/45b5e023c447d150e9d588cb5b09d369bc9d6c29.jpg"},{"name":"The new Signifer?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2056200/dd7ab567884eb6001fd4ade0d91418f8e438d0bf.jpg"},{"name":"The general\u2019s favorite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2056200/c6cc06f65d3758693b1099d231b9e83d2e17474b.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2056200?t=1747211430","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/ed5d2565236738da811cae3ace9bebba6df8bbe9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747211430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/5ef4090d48d5e4225f7acc01fc0fc6ef389ff69b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747211430","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/5ef4090d48d5e4225f7acc01fc0fc6ef389ff69b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747211430","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you survive in the wild northern Hispania of the 1st century BC? Step into the sandals of a Roman legionna